    "created_at": "2017-07-19T15:30:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-07-19T15:30:16Z",
    "body": "So far 2D canvas APIs kind of follow the unwritten rule of throwing exceptions in cases that are improper uses of the APIs, and failing silently in cases that are accidental hiccups. To be consistent with that philosophy, I think this case should result in a silent failure. FWIW, I don't feel strongly about this.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
